{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-01_beg","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"main_15-01","title":"執此劍者","storyCode":"15-2","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"d21515496541a60ddb1b03cef6aeb4b820e40eca7659f93f27d365d03f6d66ea","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g19_babeltop_ex2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（未知語言）新的冗餘資訊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡剩下的，也只有虛無？"},{"type":"narration","text":"他看著那個菱形，就像——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……盯著我的眼睛。"},{"type":"narration","text":"特雷西斯生平第一次，有了戰慄的感覺。\n但那並非來自他本能的反應，他感知到，一種他無法觸碰的意志試圖迫使他屈服——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"神明也罷，造物主也罷，直面我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"死寂，冰冷。虛無中，並無一物，也並無回應。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老師，你不應該來這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯卡綸”","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"殿下已經犯下了魯莽的錯誤。我不想再次失去我在乎的人，老師。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯卡綸”","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"離開吧，老師，時機尚未成熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不應該用她來侮辱我，自詡的造物主。"},{"type":"narration","text":"眼前的阿斯卡綸絕非幻影，這處奇妙的空間將他的記憶化為了實體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在我的記憶中，依舊還是過去的樣子，稚嫩了一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯卡綸”","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然真正掌控這裡的那些人不敢直面我，說明特蕾西婭的確成功了。他們必然已經受到了諸多的限制。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否則那些傲慢的存在也不至於試圖讓你阻止我。"},{"type":"narration","text":"特雷西斯舉起了劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯卡綸”","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師，你還是不願意跟我離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戰勝我，如果你真的想將我帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“阿斯卡綸”","speakerId":"avg_4132_ascln_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很熟練，但依舊只是我教你的技巧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“阿斯卡綸”的身形隱入了紫色的霧氣之中，那是屬於她的源石技藝。\n特雷西斯想起了他與特蕾西婭帶領薩卡茲的殘軍走入風暴中的那天……\n他隻身走入紫色的煙霧之中，抓住了那個孩子手中的刀。一如此刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不見，阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
